@startuml agentic-organization-culture-boundary
title Agentic Organization / Agentic Culture Boundary ; per ADR-ES-020 section 14

skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center

class "Agentic Organization" as AO
class "Agentic Culture" as AC

AO --> AC : influences (but !=)
AO ..> AC : NOT established by this ADR

note right
  Per ADR-ES-020 section 14 + AORG-NEG-005:
  - Agentic Organization is NOT Agentic Culture
  - Organizational culture may influence how agentic behavior is adopted
  - No Agentic Culture concept shall be created by this CR (per CR-ES-020 section 13)
end note

@enduml
